name: test_filter

nodes:
  - name: chunks
    type: Split
    split_unit: sentences
    chunk_size: 10
    overlap: 2

  - name: advice
    type: Map
    inputs:
      - chunks

  - name: filter
    type: Filter
    expression: "item.advice.response == 'yes'"
    inputs:
      - advice

---#chunks
{{input}}

---#advice

You are a linguist doing a text clasification task.
Does this text give advice to the reader?

<text>
{{input}}
</text>

Return yes if it gives advice to the reader, no otherwise.

[[pick:advice|yes,no]]
